---
import ItemPage from '../../layouts/ItemPage.astro';
import { CAKE_SIZES } from '../../data/cakes';

const faqs = [
  { q: 'How much is an Oreo Blizzard Cake at Dairy Queen?', a: 'A 10-inch Oreo Blizzard Cake typically costs about $38.74. Prices vary by location.' },
  { q: 'How many people does an Oreo Blizzard Cake serve?', a: 'The 10-inch size serves about 12 to 16 people.' },
  { q: 'What is in an Oreo Blizzard Cake?', a: 'Soft serve blended with Oreo cookie pieces, the DQ fudge and cookie crunch center, and whipped icing on top.' },
  { q: 'Do I need to order an Oreo Blizzard Cake ahead?', a: 'Some stores keep them in the freezer case. If yours does not, or you want a custom message or design, order 24 to 48 hours ahead.' },
];
---
<ItemPage
  title="Dairy Queen Oreo Blizzard Cake: Price & Size (2026)"
  description="The Oreo Blizzard Cake costs about $38.74 for a 10-inch cake that serves 12–16. What is in it, how to order and how it compares to other DQ cakes."
  name="Oreo Blizzard Cake"
  category={{ name: 'DQ Cakes', href: '/categories/dq-cakes' }}
  image="/Images/oreo-blizzard-cake.webp"
  imageAlt="Dairy Queen Oreo Blizzard ice cream cake"
  badges={['Most popular Blizzard cake', 'Serves 12–16']}
  quick="A 10-inch Oreo Blizzard Cake from Dairy Queen costs about $38.74 and serves 12 to 16 people. It is DQ’s most popular Blizzard cake, with Oreo pieces blended through the soft serve. Prices vary by location."
  from="From $38.74"
  intro="If the birthday person’s favorite Blizzard is Oreo, this is the cake to get. It tastes like an Oreo Blizzard in cake form, with the classic fudge and cookie crunch layer in the middle."
  spec={[
    ['Price', '$38.74+ (10-inch)'],
    ['Serves', '12–16 people'],
    ['Inside', 'Soft serve with Oreo pieces, fudge and cookie crunch center'],
    ['Lead time', 'Sometimes in stock; 24–48 hours for custom'],
  ]}
  allergens="Milk, Wheat, Soy"
  table={{ title: 'Compare DQ cake sizes and prices', ...CAKE_SIZES }}
  faqs={faqs}
>
  <h2>Oreo Blizzard Cake vs. classic DQ cake</h2>
  <p>The <a href="/items/dq-cake-round-10inch">classic 10-inch cake</a> costs about $6 less and has plain chocolate and vanilla soft serve. The Oreo version adds cookie pieces all the way through, so every bite has crunch. Kids and Oreo fans usually prefer it; for a mixed crowd, the classic is a safe pick.</p>

  <h2>Other Blizzard cake flavors</h2>
  <p>The <a href="/items/cookie-dough-blizzard-cake">Cookie Dough Blizzard Cake</a> is the next most popular and costs about $2.75 less. Many stores can make other Blizzard flavors too; ask when you order. Not sure which flavor? See our <a href="/blog/best-blizzard-flavors-ranked">Blizzard flavor rankings</a>.</p>

  <p>For every size and price, see the <a href="/categories/dq-cakes">DQ cake prices page</a>. To cut and store it neatly, read our <a href="/blog/dq-cakes-complete-guide">DQ cake serving guide</a>.</p>
</ItemPage>
